# Reserved Words Demo
# Shows natural language understanding of time, money, comparisons, etc.

# Define terms with semantic meaning
payment_terms - the number of days until payment is due
late_fee - the penalty amount charged for late payment
grace_period - the number of days before late fees apply
discount_rate - the percentage discount for early payment

Load document

# Check for clauses
Document must contain a Payment Terms clause
Document must contain a Late Fee provision

# Extract with automatic type inference
# Parser recognizes "days" as time unit
Find payment_terms and save as payment_terms

# Parser recognizes "fee" as currency
Find late_fee and save as late_fee

# Parser recognizes "period" with "days" as time
Find grace_period and save as grace_period

# Parser recognizes "rate" and "percentage"
Find discount_rate and save as discount_rate

# Natural language comparisons using reserved words
# "at least" = >=
payment_terms must be at least 30 days

# "at most" = <=
late_fee must be at most 500 dollars

# "between" for ranges
grace_period must be between 5 and 15 days

# Percentage validation
discount_rate must be at least 2 percent
